# Ink Portal Structure

```
src/
  pages/{Name}/
    Name.tsx
    Name.types.ts
    index.ts
    Name.const.ts      # if needed
  components/{Name}/
    Name.tsx
    Name.types.ts
    index.ts
  constants/
    numbers.ts
    generals.const.ts
    ...
  i18n/
  styles/
```

Routing via `@forgedevstack/forge-compass`.
Every page/component folder has `index.ts`.
